      "writtenOn": "2020-09-22T17:19:15Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "In principle, I don\u0027t have a problem with this change.\n\nHowever, force discharge has previously been problematic on Volteer. Note, for instance, discussion ending at http://b/163143427#comment49. As described there by eherrmann, if we do this, we would like to do it carefully.",
      "revId": "730319ba6a61c314edb80092ce3552ba00d15c1a",
