        "id": 1347775
      },
      "writtenOn": "2020-09-22T19:14:19Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yeah, the core issue we need to solve (I think) is that force discharge doesn\u0027t automatically disable itself like other PPCs do, so we need to make sure we account for that.",
      "parentUuid": "0dcca399_8a312b85",
      "revId": "730319ba6a61c314edb80092ce3552ba00d15c1a",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba",
